# What the dependences of this file have to come out as.
#
# The read of b->i before the write of b->f, through a union reached by a
# POINTER rather than as an object.  Members given a space each look
# independent and this comes back empty.
#
# NOT AN EXPECTATION ON THE TRANSLATION, though the defect this file
# records was a deleted store: measured today, with the members split
# apart the store is still emitted and it is the ORDER that goes -- both
# reads of b->i end up after it, where the first one belongs before.  A
# cell claiming the store is present would be green either way.
dep_false *: \{ S_1\[\] -> S_2\[\] \}
